 - **New:** Streamer reaction clips now come with a hook title that describes what actually happened (for example a streamer laughing at a sudden on-screen blast, never an invented event), clip windows that start on a pause and end after the reaction has died down, caption timing and placement notes that follow the reaction and keep clear of the facecam, and editing suggestions (facecam panel, a gentle punch-in on the reaction, trimming dead time). The suggestions are advisory data for the renderer. ([#TBD](https://github.com/FujiwaraChoki/supoclip/pulls))
